Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["DownsampleSchedule", "ObjectName",
 CellID->465926095,ExpressionUUID->"88885c2f-a317-994b-97e9-0b7e874a3958"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"294ac385-1bf1-1d4d-9796-1e11cef84dd5"],
 Cell[BoxData[
 "DownsampleSchedule"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "56a2eb2b-b1a9-924c-968b-2910dce451d7"],
 "\[LineSeparator]is an option for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["MakeUnet",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/MakeUnet"]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"85723c3a-5785-9741-8447-195edd0dd8e8"],
 ". It defines how the data is downsampled for each of the deeper layers of \
the Unet. By default is is a factor two for each layer. A custom schedule for \
a 5 layer 3D Unet could be {{2,2,2},{1,2,2},{2,2,2},{1,2,2}, 1}. The deepest \
layer is always downsampled by 1 and therefore not needed to be specified."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->26072488,ExpressionUUID->"4a31aa3f-63ad-f946-bd36-b76955aeb232"],

Cell["XXXX", "Notes",
 CellID->694577017,ExpressionUUID->"eaf673cd-ec70-1545-9053-c950fd49fef1"]
}, Open  ]],

